### Page 2 of 36

```text
214 W. Lincolnway ● Suite 22 ● Cheyenne, WY 82001
307.634.9888 ● www.AyresAssociates.com
January 16, 2015
Mike Vinson
City of Cheyenne, City Engineers Department
2101 O’Neil Ave., Room 206
Cheyenne, WY 82001
Re:
Technical Proposal – Lake Minnehaha Remediation Plan Phase 2
Dear Mr. Vinson:
Ayres Associates is excited that the City of Cheyenne is moving ahead with Phase 2 improvements for
the Lake Minnehaha Remediation Plan. Our staff members have enjoyed working with you on the plan
and the Phase 1 improvements, and we are ready to go to work with you to complete Phase 2. Here’s
what we offer the City:
•
Knowledge and commitment. Because we have worked with the City on so many municipal,
water resources, and transportation projects over the years, we are tuned in to your
preferences. We know your staff, goals, and procedures. We also will be able to incorporate our
past successes from other similar projects to improve the Holliday Park area for the community
to enjoy for many years to come.
•
Familiarity. Our previous experience on past Lake Minnehaha and Holliday Park projects will
allow our team to begin work immediately. We come with a solid communications plan, ready to
keep all stakeholders well-informed on the design of your project.
•
Full-service team. Not only does our team have the technical expertise to provide a design to
meet necessary specifications, but our subconsultants – Steil Surveying Services and Terracon
– are familiar to the City and Ayres Associates. This same team has worked on many projects
together and will provide a seamless group of professionals to bring your project to a successful
completion.
The signers of this proposal shown below declare that the companies interested in this contract as
principals are named herein, specifically Ayres Associates, Steil Surveying Services, and Terracon.
This proposal is offered in all respects as a fair proposal, in good faith without collusion or fraud. James
Schall, PhD, PE, has authority on behalf of Ayres Associates to bind the company at the contract value
shown in the price proposal.
Thank you for this opportunity to present our proposal. We look forward to working with you to improve
Holliday Park and the Duff Avenue corridor. If you have any questions or need more information, please
contact me.
Sincerely,
Ayres Associates Inc
Christopher G. Pletcher, PE

James D. Schall, PhD, PE

Project Manager

Vice President
307.634.9888

